            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "墨尔斯",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_904101_1071014816_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "请容我正式介绍。\n此处，是为从<style=Highlight>拾光收藏</style>中、\n获得的<style=Highlight>万象礼券</style>而设的——",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_904101_1071014816_content",
                "value": "请容我正式介绍。\n此处，是为从<style=Highlight>拾光收藏</style>中、\n获得的<style=Highlight>万象礼券</style>而设的——"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1071014816
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "墨尔斯",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_904101_1071014817_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "<style=Highlight>万礼馆</style>。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_904101_1071014817_content",
                "value": "<style=Highlight>万礼馆</style>。"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1071014817
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "爪爪",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": "？？？",
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_904101_1548685218_fakeName",
                "value": "？？？"
              },
              "content": "万礼馆开放事务，已准备妥当。\n如需使用万礼馆服务，请立即与我联系。\n限时10秒，开始倒数，10……",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_904101_1548685218_content",
                "value": "万礼馆开放事务，已准备妥当。\n如需使用万礼馆服务，请立即与我联系。\n限时10秒，开始倒数，10……"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1548685218
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "墨尔斯",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_904101_1548685219_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "等等、发生点意外……\n<style=SizeSmall>怎么重置的来着？是这个键吗？</style>",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_904101_1548685219_content",
                "value": "等等、发生点意外……\n<style=SizeSmall>怎么重置的来着？是这个键吗？</style>"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1548685219
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "爪爪",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": "？？？",
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_904101_1548685220_fakeName",
                "value": "？？？"
              },
              "content": "<style=Thoughts>嘀——</style>",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_904101_1548685220_content",
                "value": "<style=Thoughts>嘀——</style>"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1548685220
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "墨尔斯",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_904101_1548685222_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "万分抱歉，让你见笑了。\n这是负责<style=Highlight>礼品兑换</style>服务的、\n专项机器人——<style=NpcName>爪爪</style>。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_904101_1548685222_content",
                "value": "万分抱歉，让你见笑了。\n这是负责<style=Highlight>礼品兑换</style>服务的、\n专项机器人——<style=NpcName>爪爪</style>。"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1548685222
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "爪爪",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_904101_1071014818_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "爪爪，很不高兴地为你服务。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_904101_1071014818_content",
                "value": "爪爪，很不高兴地为你服务。"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1071014818
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "墨尔斯",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_904101_1071014819_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "如你所见，它有点怪，\n但不影响正常工作。<style=SizeSmall>应该……</style>",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_904101_1071014819_content",
                "value": "如你所见，它有点怪，\n但不影响正常工作。<style=SizeSmall>应该……</style>"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1071014819
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "墨尔斯",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_904101_1071014820_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "如果在<style=Highlight>展示柜</style>上，看到喜欢的礼品，\n靠近使用<style=Highlight>万象礼券</style>，\n爪爪会帮你完成<style=Highlight>礼品兑换</style>服务。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_904101_1071014820_content",
                "value": "如果在<style=Highlight>展示柜</style>上，看到喜欢的礼品，\n靠近使用<style=Highlight>万象礼券</style>，\n爪爪会帮你完成<style=Highlight>礼品兑换</style>服务。"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1071014820
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "墨尔斯",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_904101_1071014821_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "在万礼馆中，不需要任何额外支出，\n仅用万象礼券即可享受一切服务。\n这份惊喜，希望你喜欢。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_904101_1071014821_content",
                "value": "在万礼馆中，不需要任何额外支出，\n仅用万象礼券即可享受一切服务。\n这份惊喜，希望你喜欢。"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1071014821
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "墨尔斯",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
