                "textId": "Performance_904101_1548685231_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "以及，这瓶<style=Highlight>友邻露卡</style>，请收下。\n这是我的……嗯，就是……",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_904101_1548685231_content",
                "value": "以及，这瓶<style=Highlight>友邻露卡</style>，请收下。\n这是我的……嗯，就是……"
